# Cloudflare Worker conventions

- Entry: `src/worker.ts` default export; app wiring lives in `src/app.ts`. Pure helpers live under `src/lib/`.
- Bindings and `[vars]` are defined in `wrangler.toml`; run `npm run types` after changing bindings. Secrets are not in `[vars]`.
- Browser Rendering uses `@cloudflare/puppeteer` and the `BROWSER` binding; if local `wrangler dev` misbehaves, try `npm run dev:remote`.
- Durable Object class `AuthSession` is in `src/authSession.do.ts`; migrations stay append-only.
